//│   ∀α, β, γ. {α ≤ (Int ⟹ {γ ≥ Int, β ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {γ ≥ Str, β ≤ Str}), β ≤ (Int ⟹ {γ ≥ Int, α ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {γ ≥ Str, α ≤ Str, α ≤ ¬Int}), γ ≥ (Int ⟹ {β ≤ Int, α ≤ Int}) ∧ (Str ⟹ {β ≤ Str, α ≤ Str, α ≤ ¬Int})} ⟹ α → β → γ ≤ ⊤ → ⊤ → ⊥
